    "Choose whether Villain Arc schedules local notifications only for goal completions or also for coaching milestones like double goal, triple goal, and new step records. In-app toasts can still appear while you’re using the app.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose whether Villain Arc schedules local notifications only for goal completions or also for coaching milestones like double goal, triple goal, and new step records. In-app toasts can still appear while you’re using the app."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wähle, ob Villain Arc lokale Benachrichtigungen nur für erreichte Ziele oder auch für Coaching-Meilensteine wie doppeltes Ziel, dreifaches Ziel und neue Schrittrekorde plant. In-App-Hinweise können weiterhin erscheinen, während du die App nutzt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elige si Villain Arc programa notificaciones locales solo para objetivos completados o también para hitos de coaching como objetivo doble, objetivo triple y nuevos récords de pasos. Los avisos dentro de la app pueden seguir apareciendo mientras la usas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choisissez si Villain Arc programme des notifications locales uniquement pour les objectifs atteints ou aussi pour les jalons de coaching comme l'objectif doublé, triplé et les nouveaux records de pas. Les notifications dans l'app peuvent toujours apparaître pendant que vous l'utilisez."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Escolha se o Villain Arc agenda notificações locais apenas para metas concluídas ou também para marcos de coaching como meta dobrada, meta triplicada e novos recordes de passos. Os avisos dentro do app ainda podem aparecer enquanto você o usa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose whether you receive a notification when you reach your hydration goal, or also receive coaching notifications for surpassing your goal.": {
      "comment": "A description of the hydration notification mode picker.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
